WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.440
It is Passover in Jerusalem.

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:07.150
On a Thursday evening, Jesus shares
a meal with his closest followers.

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.830
Later that night, in a
garden, he is arrested.

4
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:16.140
By the next afternoon, he is dead
on a Roman cross outside the city.

5
00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:21.240
What happened in those few hours, and
why does it still matter to Christians?

6
00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:26.410
In this mission, you'll trace each step,
from a garden at night to a hill outside

7
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.570
the city.

8
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:32.640
Then you'll find out why Christians
call the day of his death Good Friday.

9
00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:37.050
Your mission: find out what happened
between the supper and the cross,

10
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.310
and why Christians believe it matters.
